"and refresh token from Spotify, which we store encrypted. We use this to "
"display your currently playing track title, artist, album artwork and "
"playback progress. No other Spotify profile data is requested. This "
"processing is based on your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR) and can be withdrawn "
"at any time by disconnecting Spotify in the overlay settings."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:79
