msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:81
msgid ""
"If you choose to connect a Twitch account to a Twitch Goal overlay, Nexora "
"requests permission to read your follower and/or subscriber counts and "
"receives an access and refresh token, which we store encrypted, along with "
"your Twitch user ID, login name, display name, profile image and cached "
"follower/subscriber counts. This processing is based on your consent (Art. "
"6(1)(a) GDPR). Disconnecting Twitch, or deleting your account, revokes the "
"token directly with Twitch."
msgstr ""

